## 五、使用方式

### 基础使用

```markdown
---
slug: education-customer-research
name: 教育行业客户深度研究
---

# 教育行业客户深度研究

## 引用搜索框架
@include shared-frameworks/search/baidu-web-search.md
@include shared-frameworks/search/customer-search-queries.md

## 执行搜索
@baidu-search:background("{{customer_name}}", "education")
@baidu-search:decision("{{customer_name}}", "education")
@baidu-search:cooperation("{{customer_name}}")

## 生成报告
### 背景资料
@search-result:background

### 决策链分析
@search-result:decision

### 历史合作
@search-result:cooperation
```

### 高级使用（全方位研究）

```markdown
---
slug: comprehensive-finance-research
name: 金融行业客户全方位研究
---

# 金融行业客户全方位研究

## 引用框架
@include shared-frameworks/search/baidu-web-search.md
@include shared-frameworks/search/customer-search-queries.md
@include shared-frameworks/search/bidding-queries.md
@include shared-frameworks/search/tech-queries.md

## 执行搜索
@baidu-search:background("{{customer_name}}", "finance")
@baidu-search:decision("{{customer_name}}", "finance")
@baidu-search:digital("{{customer_name}}", "finance")
@baidu-search:bidding("{{customer_name}}")
@baidu-search:subsidiary("{{customer_name}}")
@baidu-search:annual-report("{{customer_name}}")
@baidu-search:tech-stack("{{customer_name}}")

## 生成报告
### 1. 客户背景
@search-result:background

### 2. 决策链分析
@search-result:decision

### 3. 数字化转型
@search-result:digital

### 4. 招投标情况
@search-result:bidding

### 5. 集团架构
@search-result:subsidiary

### 6. 年报/战略
@search-result:annual-report

### 7. 技术栈分析
@search-result:tech-stack
```

### 竞品分析使用

